WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.410
SCP-049 Vs SCP-096.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.950
The Plague Doctor Vs The Shy Guy.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.540
Which of these two anomalous titans would
take home the victory in mortal combat?

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:15.509
While 049 does have the ability to induce
death with a mere touch, this only seems to

00:00:15.509 --> 00:00:20.480
actually work on non-anomalous victims, and
outside of this, his combat abilities are

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.730
woefully limited.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:27.130
Even if 049 had a legion of his reanimated
zombies at his side, we would predict that

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.169
096 would make short work of them on its quest
to tear the good doctor to shreds.

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:35.239
For that reason, it’s probably best we keep
their containment separate.

00:00:35.239 --> 00:00:39.809
Personally, we’d give this one to SCP-096,
no contest.

